BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 561.0 Tm (features, encryption modes, firmlinks, snapshot representations and sealed system volumes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 544.0 Tm (Incomplete feature support should lead to conservative read-only handling.) Tj ET
